<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>06 - Text Formatting</title>
</head>
<body>
    <p>
        <b>Teks Tebal (Bold)</b> | <strong>Teks Penting (Strong)</strong><br>
        <i>Teks Miring (Italic)</i> | <em>Teks Penekanan (Emphasized)</em><br>
        <u>Teks Garis Bawah</u> | <del>Teks Tercoret</del> | <mark>Teks Stabilo</mark><br>
        Rumus Kimia: H<sub>2</sub>O | Pangkat Matematika: X<sup>2</sup>
    </p>
</body>
</html>